        -:  388:     *        aStartNumber)
        -:  389:     * @param aHierarchy Optional sheet path hierarchy for resetting the references'
        -:  390:     *        sheet numbers based on their sheet's place in the hierarchy. Set
        -:  391:     *        nullptr if not desired.
